# ─── Host paths bind-mounted into the containers (optional) ───────────────
# All relative to ~/potatoaihub/docker. Leave unset to use the defaults shown.
# BACKEND_PATH is the Laravel checkout mounted at /var/www/backend in app, queue,
# scheduler, websockets and (public/ only) backend-nginx — it IS the running code,
# so pointing it somewhere without a vendor/ directory takes the API down.
#   BACKEND_PATH=../backend
#   FRONTEND_DIST_PATH=../frontend-dist
# Left as comments on purpose: an empty assignment with a trailing inline comment is
# parsed inconsistently by Compose and can end up as the literal path.
